[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

50
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:10,735
[Slow] 日本は、OECDに加盟する38か国の中で、何位になりましたか。

51
00:09:11,535 --> 00:09:14,871
[Host] First place — in all three main subjects.

52
00:09:15,471 --> 00:09:23,488
[Slow] 読解力の得点は、前回の調査より何点下がりましたか。

53
00:09:24,288 --> 00:09:25,943
[Host] Thirteen points.

54
00:09:26,543 --> 00:09:35,951
[Slow] 日本の生徒が平日にSNSを見る時間は、平均で何時間でしたか。

55
00:09:36,751 --> 00:09:40,735
[Host] Two point three hours — the shortest among the countries surveyed.

56
00:09:41,336 --> 00:09:50,408
[Host] That's all for today. Top of the class on paper — but the slide in reading is the number to watch. See you next time on Japanese Daily News.

57
